    <!-- ======= About Section ======= -->
    <section id="about" class="about section-bg">
      <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">

        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>About</h2>
          <h3>Find Out More <span>About Us</span></h3>
          <p> Inspired by the Bantu values of innovation, accountability and integrity, Bantu Track Pvt Ltd was founded in 2014 and has grown into one of the largest Vehicle Tracking and Telemetry Solutions providers in Zimbabwe. Our aim is to bring the highest value of innovation and technology that brings efficiency and business growth to our clients through effective management of asserts and productive monitoring through reliable telemetry services. Our system is accessible 24/7 on computers, laptops, phones or tablets. We have effective and secure mobile apps for android and IOS where you can download the application and track your asserts in real time as well as any alerts of your choice.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100">
            <img src="assets/img/about us 2.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="">
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 pt-4 pt-lg-0 content d-flex flex-column justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
            <h3>Our Vision and Mission</h3>
            <p class="fst-italic">
             Every successful business has an identity that distinct them from others through a blue print of vision and mission.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <i class="bx bx-fingerprint"></i>
                <div>
                  <h5>Our Vision</h5>
                  <p>To lead African innovation in asset management.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <i class="bx bx-fingerprint"></i>
                <div>
                  <h5>Our Mission</h5>
                  <p>To provide efficient and vehicle tracking system that companies and institutions can relate to the Bantu way.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
             <!-- put additional information here -->
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
 <div class="row">
            
              <div class="col-lg-6 pt-4 pt-lg-0 content d-flex flex-column justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <h3>What we can do</h3>
                <p class="fst-italic">
                  Our vehicle tracking system allows  users to monitor the location of  , trailers and other vehicles. The software is connected to the vehicles via GPS, giving companies real-time insight into the geographic position of their vehicles.
                </p>
               
              </div>
              <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100">
                <img src="assets/img/Gallery/8.jpg" class="img-fluid" width="550" height="200" alt="">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100">
                <img src="assets/img/Gallery/7.jpg" class="img-fluid" width="550" height="200" alt="">
              </div>
              <div class="col-lg-6 pt-4 pt-lg-0 content d-flex flex-column justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <h3>What the system can do</h3>
                <p class="fst-italic">
                  Bantu  vehicle tracking system  allows tracking and controlling of vehicles via an online computer, smart phone, tablet, etc. on a 24/7 basis for Geo fencing capabilities, fuel monitoring, alerts and SMS, location detection and engine blocking amongst other things.
                </p>
               
              </div>
              
            </div>
      </div>
